{
  "name": "dsh-ui-tweaks",
  "version": "0.8.0",
  "author": "MeganeOnly",
  "description": "DSH 外观设计微调合集（v0.8.0：新增 first-message-jump「回到最早消息」tweak——对话区右下角（输入框上方）悬浮按钮，点击把当前会话最早一条 user 消息滚到滚动区顶部，长会话里快速回看最初发的需求；纯 JS DOM 探测不依赖 DSH CSS hash，只在最早消息不在视口内时显示，右侧抽屉打开时自动隐藏。当前包含 conversation-shift、conversation-shift-debug、simple-mode、hide-sidebar-tooltip、hide-trajectory-tab、hide-chat-tab、first-message-jump 七条 tweak。v0.7.5 详见 CHANGELOG。状态由 client half 用 localStorage 自管。",
  "license": "MIT",
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "https://github.com/MeganeOnly/meganeonly-dsh-plugins.git",
    "directory": "dsh-ui-tweaks"
  },
  "bugs": {
    "url": "https://github.com/MeganeOnly/meganeonly-dsh-plugins/issues"
  },
  "homepage": "https://github.com/MeganeOnly/meganeonly-dsh-plugins/tree/main/dsh-ui-tweaks#readme",
  "keywords": [
    "dsh",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "ui",
    "css",
    "appearance",
    "customization"
  ],
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "scripts": {
    "build:client": "node lib/build-client.cjs",
    "verify:client": "node lib/verify-client.cjs",
    "prepare": "node lib/build-client.cjs"
  },
  "exports": {
    ".": "./lib/index.js",
    "./client": "./lib/client.js",
    "./cordis.patch.yml": "./cordis.patch.yml",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "lib",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "README.md",
    "CHANGELOG.md",
    "LICENSE",
    "package.json"
  ],
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "platform": "web"
    }
  }
}
